# GadgetPack

GadgetPack (formerly 8GadgetPack) makes it possible to use Gadgets on Windows 11 / 10.

![GadgetPack screenshot](https://cdn.statically.io/gh/wooky/my-choco-packs@master/packages/8gadgetpack/gadgetpack_screenshot.jpg)

* It installs the Gadget Platform that was originally present in Windows 7 with some modifications that make it work on newer Operating Systems.
* It also installs some Gadgets (see list below) which were also modified to work and look better.
* .gadget files can also be installed when GadgetPack is installed.
* For more information on how to use it, see the [How-to](https://gadgetpack.net/howto.html). For more detailed information and answers to common questions, see the [FAQ](https://gadgetpack.net/faq.html).
* It's free!

## Gadgets included

The following Gadgets are installed automatically with GadgetPack:

* 7 Sidebar - Helmut Buhler
* Agenda - Ronnie
* All CPU Meter - AddGadgets.com
* App Launcher - Dean Laforet
* Battery Meter - Vitim
* Breathe - danvdragos
* Calendar - Microsoft
* Clipboarder - Helmut Buhler
* Clock (Analog) - Microsoft
* Clock (Digital) - s.blank
* Color Palette - Plain Wonders
* Currency - Microsoft
* Control System - AddGadgets.com
* Control Panel - Legiones
* Countdown - Alexander Burton
* CPU Meter - Microsoft
* Date &amp; Time - buildagadget.com
* Desktop Calculator - Home Cooked Gadgets
* Display Sleep - Exodus-Sx
* DriveInfo - Kris Thompson
* Drive Activity - Sascha Katzner
* Drives Meter - AddGadgets.com
* Glassy CPU Monitor - Helmut Buhler
* Glassy Network Monitor - Helmut Buhler
* GPU Meter - AddGadgets.com
* HUD Time - Factor Mystic
* Mousometer - Sven Bader
* MSN Weather - Microsoft
* My Weather - Pat Possible
* Network Meter - AddGadgets.com
* Network Monitor II - Igor M. Bushin
* Picture Puzzle - Microsoft
* Power Status - Orbmu2k
* Recycle Bin - Eiskalter Engel
* Reminder (Denk-Daran) - dahi24
* Remove Drive Safely - Plamen Todorov
* searchALL Gadget - Jayden Howard
* ShutdownRestart - Midnight Mick
* Slide Show - Microsoft
* Sticky Notes - Microsoft
* Top Five - Orbmu2k
* Turn off PC - Carlos A. Prialé Condori
* Unit Converter - GadgetWE
* Volume Control - Orbmu2k
* Webradio-Player - dahi24
* スクロールカレンダー - 66turn
